You are able to target your throwing knives with pinpoint accuracy, increasing their critical strike chance by [3%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 14% (TL1-5)] and critical strike damage by [7%, 11%, 14%, 17%, 20% (TL1-5)].

In addition, your critical strikes with throwing knives have a [16%, 25%, 31%, 36%, 40% (TL1-5)] chance to randomly disable your target, possibly disarming, silencing or pinning them for 2 turns.
